config MI_HARDWARE_ID
	tristate "Xiaomi hardware ID"
	depends on QCOM_SOCINFO
	help
	  Exposes the board description the Xiaomi bootloader passes on the
	  kernel command line (hwid.project, hwid.hwid_value, hwid.project_adc
	  and hwid.build_adc) to the drivers that adapt to the project,
	  hardware revision or sales region.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called hwid.
